# QA Playtest

Adopt when testing, validating builds, or documenting bugs.

**Core loop test:** Player move, auto-fire, enemy spawn, damage, XP drop, collect, level-up, upgrade popup, HUD, game over.
**Performance:** FPS >30 with 50+ entities, no memory leaks, no orphan nodes.
**Mobile:** Joystick zone, no dead zones, tappable UI, readable on 6".
**Bug template:** Severity, steps, expected, actual, console errors.
